B.af7=new A.cP("Calostro bovino","Primer fluido nutritivo producido por la vaca despu\xe9s del parto; contiene prote\xednas y compuestos de apoyo inmunol\xf3gico.","The first nutrient-rich fluid produced by a cow after birth; it contains proteins and immune-support compounds.")
